This product includes software developed for the Abrams Event Address (AEA) project.

Cryptographic Component:
- The SHA-256 implementation located in `src/sha256.rs` is an original, self-contained,
  zero-allocation cleanroom implementation of NIST FIPS 180-4 (Secure Hash Standard).
- It does NOT depend on the external `sha2` crate or any third-party cryptography libraries.
- Provenance details are documented in `third_party/sha256/ORIGIN.txt`.
